{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:.gitignore",
    "title": "本地运行产物与评审数据忽略策略",
    "summary": "该文件排除依赖、构建产物、本地环境与运行数据，同时保留环境变量示例；对 repo-review，它明确区分受版本控制的冻结基线、知识资产与被忽略的实时运行目录。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "general",
        "title": "常规本地产物隔离",
        "body": "忽略规则覆盖依赖目录、构建输出、`.omem/` 本地状态、测试报告、Playwright 报告及 osdk 本地目录。`.env` 和各类 `.env.*` 默认被排除，但 `.env.example` 被显式重新纳入，体现“秘密留在本地、模板进入版本库”的配置边界。规则表达的是版本控制意图，不能单独证明相关文件从未被提交。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "review-boundary",
        "title": "repo-review 三类资产",
        "body": "注释将 repo-review 数据分为三类：冻结的运行基线被有意跟踪；实时写入迁移到 `.repo-review/runtime/` 后忽略；curated knowledge、清单和种子继续受版本控制。缓存、临时目录、模型输出和嵌入也被排除。由于 Git 忽略规则不影响已跟踪文件，这些模式不能作为冻结资产已被删除或取消跟踪的证据。[[c2]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "通用忽略项与环境模板例外",
        "reason": "支持依赖、构建、本地状态和测试产物被忽略，以及 `.env.example` 被保留的结论。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:.gitignore",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 13
        },
        "quote": "node_modules/\ndist/\napps/web/dist/\n.omem/\n.env\n.env.*\n!.env.example\nomem.local.json\ntest-results/\nplaywright-report/\ndocs/implementation/screenshots/*.png\n.osdk/\n**/.osdk-manifest.json"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "repo-review 数据边界",
        "reason": "支持冻结基线、实时运行目录、知识资产及派生缓存之间的版本控制边界。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:.gitignore",
          "startLine": 15,
          "endLine": 25
        },
        "quote": "# repo-review: the runtime baseline (.repo-review/data sqlite/WAL, browser.*.log,\n# last-sync.*, migrated-v2.flag) is intentionally tracked as a reproducible snapshot.\n# The live runtime moves to .repo-review/runtime/ on first boot and is ignored;\n# already-tracked files are unaffected by these patterns. Curated knowledge\n# (.repo-review/knowledge/**, manifests, seeds) stays version-controlled.\n.repo-review/runtime/\n.repo-review/cache/\n.repo-review/tmp/\n.repo-review/temp/\n.repo-review/model-outputs/\n.repo-review/embeddings/"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "当前仓库中的 repo-review 冻结基线和 curated knowledge 是否仍按注释所述保持跟踪？",
        "why": "`.gitignore` 只定义未跟踪文件的默认处理，不能证明具体文件当前的跟踪状态或历史上没有发生删除。",
        "nextStep": "通过版本控制状态和文件清单核对冻结基线、知识资产与实时运行目录的实际归属。",
        "blocking": false,
